🧮 Important Formulas

Angle between hands:

Angle = |30H − 5.5M|

Where:
H = Hour
M = Minutes

Minute hand movement:
6° per minute

Hour hand movement:
0.5° per minute

Relative speed of hands:
5.5° per minute

